<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title>Lease Agreement</title>
    <style>
        /* lora-regular - latin */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Lora';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 400;
            src: url('classpath:/static/fonts/lora-v37-latin-regular.ttf') format('truetype'); /* Chrome 4+, Firefox 3.5+, IE 9+, Safari 3.1+, iOS 4.2+, Android Browser 2.2+ */
        }

        /* lora-500 - latin */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Lora';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 500;
            src: url('classpath:/static/fonts/lora-v37-latin-500.ttf') format('truetype'); /* Chrome 4+, Firefox 3.5+, IE 9+, Safari 3.1+, iOS 4.2+, Android Browser 2.2+ */
        }

        /* lora-600 - latin */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Lora';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 600;
            src: url('classpath:/static/fonts/lora-v37-latin-600.ttf') format('truetype'); /* Chrome 4+, Firefox 3.5+, IE 9+, Safari 3.1+, iOS 4.2+, Android Browser 2.2+ */
        }

        /* outfit-regular - latin */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Outfit';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 400;
            src: url('classpath:/static/fonts/outfit-v15-latin-regular.ttf') format('truetype'); /* Chrome 36+, Opera 23+, Firefox 39+, Safari 12+, iOS 10+ */
        }

        /* outfit-500 - latin */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Outfit';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 500;
            src: url('classpath:/static/fonts/outfit-v15-latin-500.ttf') format('truetype'); /* Chrome 36+, Opera 23+, Firefox 39+, Safari 12+, iOS 10+ */
        }

        /* outfit-600 - latin */
        @font-face {
            font-family: 'Outfit';
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 600;
            src: url('classpath:/static/fonts/outfit-v15-latin-600.ttf') format('truetype'); /* Chrome 36+, Opera 23+, Firefox 39+, Safari 12+, iOS 10+ */
        }

        @page {
            size: A4; margin: 20mm;

            @bottom-right {
                content: "Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);
                font-size: 10pt;
                color: #555;
            }
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Lora', serif;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #2c3e50;
            page-break-inside: auto;
        }

        .container {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            page-break-inside: auto;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .parties {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .party {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .party-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            display: inline-block;
            width: 120px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-decoration: underline;
            page-break-after: avoid;
        }

        .section-content {
            margin-left: 20px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .term-item {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .signature-section {
            margin-top: 50px;
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            padding-top: 30px;
            page-break-before: always;
        }

        .signature-line {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 45%;
            margin-right: 5%;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .signature-blank {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            height: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .signature-name {
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .date-line {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .highlight {
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                background-color: white;
            }

            .container {
                border: none;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>{{^leaseAccepted}}
            DRAFT {{/leaseAccepted}}{{#isRental}}
            RESIDENTIAL LEASE AGREEMENT{{/isRental}}{{^isRental}}PROPERTY SALE AGREEMENT{{/isRental}}</h1>
    </div>

<!--    <div class="parties">-->

<!--        <p>-->
<!--            <span class="party-label">Landlord:</span> {{landlord_name}}<br/>-->
<!--            <span class="party-label">Contact:</span> {{landlord_contact}}<br/>-->
<!--        </p>-->

<!--        <p style="margin-top: 15px;">-->
<!--            <span class="party-label">Tenant:</span> {{tenant_name}}<br/>-->
<!--            <span class="party-label">Contact:</span> {{tenant_contact}}<br/>-->
<!--        </p>-->

<!--        <p style="margin-top: 15px;">-->
<!--            <span class="party-label">Property:</span> {{property_name}}<br/>-->
<!--            <span class="party-label">Address:</span> {{property_address}}-->
<!--        </p>-->
<!--    </div>-->

    {{#isRental}}
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">1. PARTIES TO THE AGREEMENT</div>
                <div class="section-content">
                    <p>
                        An agreement made on <span class="highlight">{{lease_date}}</span> between
                        <span class="highlight">{{landlord_name}}</span> of Registration/ID No.
                        <span class="highlight">{{landlord_id}}</span>, P.O. Box <span class="highlight">{{landlord_address}}</span>
                        (hereinafter called “the Lessor”) of the one part, and
                        <span class="highlight">{{tenant_name}}</span> of ID number <span class="highlight">{{tenant_id}}</span>,
                        Telephone <span class="highlight">{{tenant_contact}}</span>, Email <span class="highlight">{{tenant_contact}}</span>,
                        P.O. Box <span class="highlight">{{tenant_address}}</span> (hereinafter called “the Lessee/tenant”) of the other part.
                    </p>
                </div>
            <div class="section-title">2. WHEREAS</div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>
                    The Lessor is the owner of <span class="highlight">{{property_name}}</span>, Unit Number
                    <span class="highlight">{{unit_number}}</span> located at <span class="highlight">{{property_address}}</span>, (Hereafter referred to
                    as the ``lease property``)  AND WHEREAS the Lessor agrees to let and the Lessee agrees to take ALL
                    THAT premises identified above,
                </p>
                {{#isSelfRenew}}
                    <p>
                        for a term of {{lease_duration}} months, commencing from {{move_in_date}}, and terminating on
                        the day of {{move_out_date}}, (hereinafter called the "Tenancy period"). It shall self renew and
                        continue until terminated in accordance with the provisions of this Lease.
                    </p>
                {{/isSelfRenew}}
                {{^isSelfRenew}}
                    <p>
                        for a term of {{lease_duration}} months, commencing from {{move_in_date}}, and terminating on
                        the day of {{move_out_date}}, (hereinafter called the "Tenancy period").
                    </p>
                {{/isSelfRenew}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">3. NOW THIS TENANCY AGREEMENT WITNESSETH </div>as follows: -
            <div class="section-content">
                <div class="section-title">3.1 Rent Payment</div>
                <div class="term-item">
                    The lessee shall pay a monthly rent of {{price}} payable monthly in advance by date {{rent_due_date}}
                    day of the month without any deductions whatsoever OR only with prior AND mutual written agreement
                    to the Landlord.

<!--                    <span class="highlight">Monthly Rent:</span> The Tenant agrees to pay {{price}} per month, due-->
<!--                    and payable on or before the {{rent_due_date}} day of each month.-->
                    {{#hasCharges}}
                        <div class="section-title">3.1.1 ADDITIONAL CHARGES</div>
                        <div class="section-content">
                            {{#hasSecurityDeposit}}
                                <div class="term-item">
                                    <span class="highlight">Security Deposit:</span>
                                    Tenant shall deposit {{security_deposit}} prior to occupancy.
                                    This deposit shall be held as security for the faithful performance of all terms of this Lease
                                    and shall be refundable upon termination, less any lawful deductions.
                                </div>
                            {{/hasSecurityDeposit}}

                            {{#hasLatePaymentFee}}
                                <div class="term-item">
                                    <span class="highlight">Late Fee:</span>
                                    Any delays beyond the payment date of {{rent_due_date}} day of the month will attract a penalty
                                    fee {{late_payment_fee}} per day until the amount is paid in full (“Late Fee”).
                                </div>
                            {{/hasLatePaymentFee}}

                            {{#hasServiceCharge}}
                                <div class="term-item">
                                    <span class="highlight">Service Charge:</span>
                                    Tenant shall pay a {{service_charge_period}} service charge of {{service_charge_amount}}
                                    covering shared utilities, maintenance of common areas, and other building services.
                                </div>
                            {{/hasServiceCharge}}

                            {{#hasWaterFees}}
                                <div class="term-item">
                                    <span class="highlight">Water Fees:</span>
                                    Tenant shall be responsible for water usage charges amounting to {{water_fee_amount}}
                                    per {{water_fee_unit}} on a {{water_fee_period}} basis.
                                    The landlord shall ensure accurate meter readings and fair billing.
                                </div>
                            {{/hasWaterFees}}

                            {{#hasElectricityFees}}
                                <div class="term-item">
                                    <span class="highlight">Electricity Fees:</span>
                                    Tenant shall pay for electricity consumption billed at {{electricity_fee_amount}}
                                    per {{electricity_fee_unit}} on a {{electricity_fee_period}} basis.
                                </div>
                            {{/hasElectricityFees}}

                            {{#hasGarbageFees}}
                                <div class="term-item">
                                    <span class="highlight">Garbage Collection Fees:</span>
                                    Tenant shall pay {{garbage_fee_amount}} on a {{garbage_fee_period}} basis
                                    for waste collection and disposal services.
                                </div>
                            {{/hasGarbageFees}}

                            {{#hasSecurityFees}}
                                <div class="term-item">
                                    <span class="highlight">Security Fees:</span>
                                    Tenant shall pay {{security_fee_amount}} on a {{security_fee_period}} basis
                                    toward on-site security services and surveillance.
                                </div>
                            {{/hasSecurityFees}}

                            {{#hasParkingFees}}
                                <div class="term-item">
                                    <span class="highlight">Parking Fees:</span>
                                    Tenant shall pay {{parking_fee_amount}} on a {{parking_fee_period}} basis
                                    {{#parking_fee_unit}}per {{parking_fee_unit}}{{/parking_fee_unit}}
                                    for the use of parking space(s) assigned under this Lease.
                                </div>
                            {{/hasParkingFees}}

                        </div>
                    {{/hasCharges}}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    {{/isRental}}

    {{^isRental}}
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">1. SALE AGREEMENT</div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>This agreement represents the sale of unit {{unit_ref}} located at {{property_name}}
                    , {{property_address}} between {{landlord_name}} (the Seller) and {{tenant_name}} (the Buyer).</p>
                <p>The agreed sale amount is <span class="highlight">{{price}}</span>. The Buyer agrees to pay the
                    amount according to the mutually agreed payment schedule.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    {{/isRental}}

    {{#hasCharges}}
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">{{#isRental}}
                3.1.1 ADDITIONAL CHARGES{{/isRental}}{{^isRental}}2. CHARGES AND FEES{{/isRental}}</div>
            <div class="section-content">
                {{#hasSecurityDeposit}}
                    <div class="term-item">
                        <span class="highlight">Security Deposit:</span>
                        Tenant shall deposit {{security_deposit}} prior to occupancy.
                        This deposit shall be held as security for the faithful performance of all terms of this Lease
                        and shall be refundable upon termination, less any lawful deductions.
                    </div>
                {{/hasSecurityDeposit}}

                {{#hasLatePaymentFee}}
                    <div class="term-item">
                        <span class="highlight">Late Fee:</span>
                        Any delays beyond the payment date of {{rent_due_date}} day of the month will attract a penalty
                        fee {{late_payment_fee}} per day until the amount is paid in full (“Late Fee”).
                    </div>
                {{/hasLatePaymentFee}}

                {{#hasServiceCharge}}
                    <div class="term-item">
                        <span class="highlight">Service Charge:</span>
                        Tenant shall pay a {{service_charge_period}} service charge of {{service_charge_amount}}
                        covering shared utilities, maintenance of common areas, and other building services.
                    </div>
                {{/hasServiceCharge}}

                {{#hasWaterFees}}
                    <div class="term-item">
                        <span class="highlight">Water Fees:</span>
                        Tenant shall be responsible for water usage charges amounting to {{water_fee_amount}}
                        per {{water_fee_unit}} on a {{water_fee_period}} basis.
                        The landlord shall ensure accurate meter readings and fair billing.
                    </div>
                {{/hasWaterFees}}

                {{#hasElectricityFees}}
                    <div class="term-item">
                        <span class="highlight">Electricity Fees:</span>
                        Tenant shall pay for electricity consumption billed at {{electricity_fee_amount}}
                        per {{electricity_fee_unit}} on a {{electricity_fee_period}} basis.
                    </div>
                {{/hasElectricityFees}}

                {{#hasGarbageFees}}
                    <div class="term-item">
                        <span class="highlight">Garbage Collection Fees:</span>
                        Tenant shall pay {{garbage_fee_amount}} on a {{garbage_fee_period}} basis
                        for waste collection and disposal services.
                    </div>
                {{/hasGarbageFees}}

                {{#hasSecurityFees}}
                    <div class="term-item">
                        <span class="highlight">Security Fees:</span>
                        Tenant shall pay {{security_fee_amount}} on a {{security_fee_period}} basis
                        toward on-site security services and surveillance.
                    </div>
                {{/hasSecurityFees}}

                {{#hasParkingFees}}
                    <div class="term-item">
                        <span class="highlight">Parking Fees:</span>
                        Tenant shall pay {{parking_fee_amount}} on a {{parking_fee_period}} basis
                        {{#parking_fee_unit}}per {{parking_fee_unit}}{{/parking_fee_unit}}
                        for the use of parking space(s) assigned under this Lease.
                    </div>
                {{/hasParkingFees}}

            </div>
        </div>
    {{/hasCharges}}
    {{^isRental}}
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">3. TRANSFER OF OWNERSHIP</div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Upon full payment of the sale amount, ownership shall transfer to the Buyer, and the Seller shall
                    execute all relevant documents to facilitate this transfer.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    {{/isRental}}
    

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">4. USE OF PROPERTY</div>
        <div class="section-content">
            <p>The property shall be used solely as a {{property_type}} unit. Tenant shall not use the property for any
                illegal purpose or engage in any activity that violates applicable local, state, or federal laws. Tenant
                shall not create a nuisance or maintain a condition that interferes with other residents' quiet
                enjoyment of their spaces.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">5. PETS</div>
        <div class="section-content">
            <p>{{pets_policy}}</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    {{#isRental}}
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">6. LEASE TERMINATION AND NOTICE</div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Either party may terminate this Lease by providing {{notice_period}} months written notice to the
                    other
                    party. Notice must be delivered in person, by message, or by email.{{^isSelfRenew}}
                        Tenant must vacate the property and
                        return all keys on or before {{move_out_date}}.{{/isSelfRenew}} Property must be left in clean,
                    undamaged condition
                    (normal wear and tear excepted).</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">7. SECURITY DEPOSIT RETURN</div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>The Landlord shall return the security deposit within {{deposit_return_days}} days of the lease
                    termination date, less any deductions for unpaid rent, damages beyond normal wear and tear, or
                    cleaning
                    costs. The Landlord shall provide an itemized list of any deductions.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">8. MAINTENANCE AND REPAIRS</div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>Tenant shall maintain the property in clean and sanitary condition. Tenant shall be responsible for
                    minor
                    repairs and maintenance costing less than {{repair_threshold}}. The Landlord shall be responsible
                    for
                    major repairs, structural issues, and repairs costing {{repair_threshold}} or more. Tenant shall
                    promptly report any maintenance issues to the Landlord.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">9. ENTRY AND INSPECTION</div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>The Landlord shall have the right to enter the property upon {{entry_notice_days}} days written
                    notice
                    for purposes of inspection, maintenance, repairs, or showing to prospective tenants or buyers. Entry
                    shall occur during reasonable business hours except in case of emergency.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">10. DEFAULT AND EVICTION</div>
            <div class="section-content">
                <p>If Tenant fails to pay rent when due, violates any material term of this Lease, or engages in illegal
                    activity on the premises, Tenant shall be in default. Upon default, the Landlord may pursue legal
                    remedies including eviction proceedings. Tenant shall be responsible for all court costs and
                    attorney
                    fees associated with eviction.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    {{/isRental}}

    <div class="section">
        <div class="section-title">{{#isRental}}
            11. ENTIRE AGREEMENT{{/isRental}}{{^isRental}}6. ENTIRE AGREEMENT{{/isRental}}</div>
        <div class="section-content">
            <p>This Lease constitutes the entire agreement between the parties and supersedes all prior negotiations,
                representations, and agreements. No modifications shall be valid unless in writing and signed by both
                parties.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="signature-section">
        <div class="signature-line">
            <div class="signature-blank"></div>
            <div class="signature-name">Landlord Signature</div>
            <div class="date-line">
                <span class="highlight">Date:</span> _____________________
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="signature-line">
            <div class="signature-blank"></div>
            <div class="signature-name">Tenant Signature</div>
            <div class="date-line">
                <span class="highlight">Date:</span> _____________________
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>